      "side": 1,
      "message": "contentHash() is memoized per SkImageFilter instance, but cc rebuilds the SkImageFilter from the PaintFilter for every raster task, so in Chrome this serializes the whole filter DAG once per filtered layer per tile per frame. For SkPictureImageFilter (SVG reference filters, masks) that is a full picture serialization each time. Needs a measurement on a common non-benchmark filter page before this is net positive.",
      "revId": "4df3a7f980e3a3f6d3c43538ee56daae2c6411cc",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
