        "id": 3661524
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-05T16:30:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The child is evaluated with desiredOutput \u003d the full rounded crop rect (up to 1024x1024) instead of the context\u0027s desired output. Under tiled raster, every tile that touches this filter now evaluates the whole 1024^2 region on a cache miss instead of its own ~256^2 slice; if the child can\u0027t hit the cache (animated SkPictureImageFilter content, per-frame source), that is up to 16x the filter work plus a 4 MB intermediate per tile. Needs a guard that falls back to the normal path when the cache is known not to help, or a bound relative to the actual desired output.",
      "revId": "4df3a7f980e3a3f6d3c43538ee56daae2c6411cc",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
